; Bazel and Starlark files open in the code editor, where the starlark content type (Bazel/BazelContentTypes.cs) applies
; the grammar, completion, checks and the Starlark language server. BUILD and WORKSPACE have no extension; the content
; type maps them by file name, and language project trees give them the Bazel icon themselves.
